# Headset session 16, launch 1 of 1: the game WITHOUT its thread priority boost (RealtimeKit nice -15 on the
# threads a headset frame waits on, commit 673408a) and WITHOUT the utilisation clamp on the game thread and
# frame worker (commit 4b87fcf). Both landed on 2026-10-13 after session 3's build ff9b277, the only session
# without doubling, and were in every doubled session since (H4 build 2fe42c4 onwards). Everything else the
# game does has been cleared (sessions 12-15: poses, images, layers, pairs, quad, desktop present, release
# ordering, GPU load size, refresh rate). Candidate: the boosted threads delay SteamVR's compositor on the
# CPU inside the refresh, hitting one eye's compose. Expect the game thread to run a little less smoothly.
# Routine as always: menus, Time Trial, head turns at the countdown, then driving, hold still, quit.
KARTFRAME_THREADPRIO=off
KARTFRAME_UCLAMP=0
KARTFRAME_FRAME_LOG=1
KARTFRAME_RECORD=raw
KARTFRAME_SESSION_ENV_ONCE=1
